# Upstream robustness fixes from TheSuperHackers/GeneralsGameCode (newer than the engine base), plus a hand-written
# hardening of the BIG archive reader (mods are downloaded files, so their archives are not trusted).
#   d6c32650 #3546 LAN tooltip crash after the host left     c96b610f #3633 locomotor reset crash on map.ini
#   02b5b56e #3489 rivers that overflow the index buffer     3d82630f #3529 weapon slot index sanity check
#   9298f33b #3361 FieldParse null terminators               a30d0613 #3612 leave at once from the disconnect screen
#   afc2a103 #3641 release held modifiers on focus reset     d1105e30 #3651 Matrix4x4 compare without UB
#   6e4a328b #3346 firewall helper stack overflow
# BIG reader (StdBIGFileSystem, Win32BIGFileSystem): the entry name must end inside the buffer and the file, the file
# count must fit the file, each entry must lie inside the archive. Upstream's fuller rewrite is c7b7814e #3588.

